Done. Summary of changes:

**`src/lib.rs`** — added public function:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```
Exact-match via `==` (not substring), preserves relative order, returns borrowed `&Note`s.

**`src/main.rs`** — `list` now scans args after the command for a `--tag <TAG>` pair (single-pass state machine, no extra deps) and passes the result through `filter_by_tag`; without the flag it lists all notes as before.

